godb-driver-exception-unexpectedvalueexception.php" class="classname">MongoDB\Driver\Exception\UnexpectedValueException</a></span> if the BSON iterator could not be initialized.</li>  </ul> </div> <div class="refsect1 seealso" id="refsect1-mongodb-bson-packedarray.getiterator-seealso">  <h3 class="title">参见</h3>  <ul class="simplelist">   <li><a href="https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/bson-types/" class="link external">»&nbsp;BSON Types</a></li>  </ul> </div></div>
 */
    final public function getIterator(): Iterator {}

