 * <div id="mongodb-bson-packedarray.tostring" class="refentry"> <div class="refnamediv">  <h1 class="refname">MongoDB\BSON\PackedArray::__toString</h1>  <p class="verinfo">(mongodb &gt;=1.16.0)</p><p class="refpurpose"><span class="refname">MongoDB\BSON\PackedArray::__toString</span> — <span class="dc-title">Returns the string representation of this BSON array</span></p> </div> <div class="refsect1 description" id="refsect1-mongodb-bson-packedarray.tostring-description">  <h3 class="title">说明</h3>  <div class="methodsynopsis dc-description">   <span class="modifier">final</span> <span class="modifier">public</span> <span class="modifier">function</span> <span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832"><strong>MongoDB\BSON\PackedArray::__toString</strong></span>(): <span class="type" style="color:#EAB766"><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/language.types.string.php" class="type string" style="color:#EAB766">string</a></span></div> </div> <div class="refsect1 parameters" id="refsect1-mongodb-bson-packedarray.tostring-parameters">  <h3 class="title">参数</h3>  <p class="simpara">此函数没有参数。</p> </div> <div class="refsect1 returnvalues" id="refsect1-mongodb-bson-packedarray.tostring-returnvalues">  <h3 class="title">返回值</h3>  <p class="simpara">   Returns the string representation of this array as BSON.  </p> </div> <div class="refsect1 seealso" id="refsect1-mongodb-bson-packedarray.tostring-seealso">  <h3 class="title">参见</h3>  <ul class="simplelist">   <li><a href="https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/bson-types/" class="link external">»&nbsp;BSON Types</a></li>  </ul> </div></div>
